{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T16:51:54+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-29T16:51:54+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"EDP, S.A.","sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Diversified","country":"Portugal","city":"Lisbon","website":"https://edp.com","employees":11625,"summary":"EDP, S.A. engages in the generation, transmission, distribution, and supply of electricity in Portugal, Spain, France, Poland, Romania, Italy, Belgium, the United Kingdom, Greece, Colombia, Brazil, North America, and internationally. It operates through Renewables, Networks, and Client Solutions & Energy Management segments. The company generates and sells electricity through hydro, combined-cycle gas turbine, coal, wind, solar, nuclear, and cogeneration and waste sources. The company is also involved in the supply of natural gas. In addition, it offers engineering, laboratory tests, professional training, and energy services, as well as property management services. The company was formerly known as EDP - Energias de Portugal, S.A. and changed its name to EDP, S.A. in April 2024. The company was incorporated in 1976 and is headquartered in Lisbon, Portugal.","exchange":"Lisbon","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"EDP, S.A. s’engage dans la production, le transport, la distribution et la fourniture d’électricité au Portugal, en Espagne, en France, en Pologne, en Roumanie, en Italie, en Belgique, au Royaume-Uni, en Grèce, en Colombie, au Brésil, en Amérique du Nord et à l’international. Il opère à travers les secteurs des énergies renouvelables, des réseaux et des solutions clients et de la gestion de l'énergie. L'entreprise produit et vend de l'électricité à partir de sources hydroélectriques, de turbines à gaz à cycle combiné, de charbon, d'énergie éolienne, solaire, nucléaire, de cogénération et de déchets."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":20252082176,"share